    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32515" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlōrīnus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		1. olor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a swan</i>
			or <i>swans</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pennae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 187</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">alae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 10, 718</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				i. e. <i>white</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					37, 10, 59, § 163</span></i>
			 (al. orobini): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">OLORINO DE IOVE,</span>”
				i. e. <i>in the form of a swan</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 99, 3</span></i>
			.</div>
